      "do": "Oven 425°. Toss chopped parsley + lemon zest; set aside. Toss tomatoes with ¼ cup olive oil + thyme; salt + pepper; roast 20–25 min until collapsed. Cook sliced onion + garlic in 2 Tbsp olive oil 4–5 min; skip red-pepper flakes. Add beans + 1½ cups broth; simmer; smash ½ cup beans. Add roasted tomatoes + juices; simmer 5–10 min. Top with parsley-lemon + olive oil. Toast sourdough. Toss salad greens with olive oil + lemon juice.",
